OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian seriously injured as
OL,4,Atwo cars crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe northbound carriageway of Bourges
OL,7,FBoulevard, near the A47, remained
OL,8,Fclosed while emergency services dealt
OL,9,Fwith the incident. Motorists have been
OL,10,Fadvised to avoid the area and to expect
OL,11,Fdelays.
